<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TABLE-Czech Cokoladovny H1 earnings.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Czech Cokoladovny H1 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six-month period</p>
<p>ending June 30, 1997: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> pre-tax profit		788.868	  600.839</p>
<p> after-tax profit	    470.364	  362.012</p>
<p> operating profit	    745.521	  639.024</p>
<p> depreciation		  276.398	  265.161</p>
<p>sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services		5,010.446	4,802.671</p>
<p> other sales		   129.781	  116.461</p>
<p> basic capital	     3,127.701	3,127.701</p>
<p> total assets		8,183.670	6,495.798</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Cokoladovny a.s., a confectioner and snack  foods maker. Results filed with Prague Stock Exchange and provided  by the bourse.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
